{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_040_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0da17ca765284b4f866b3635498df8d6fb12c874783dc3b50c54ed8bfefccde5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3936754febd69d2696e28437329bef87873b26aefbd1501cb90aabad94497777",
      "text": "那巧克力算什么。是要给本大爷的供品吗？\n拿过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37061f3b9a631185567a07a926dfb6f44269acb5093d98b6676368511d2be073",
      "text": "啊啊？只准备了这么一点点，\n你是认真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee8cf42b1a455de19e849502c0481160e034e5efa0c15d00188ec6d377743d6b",
      "text": "再给我备个100份！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc4dde5d551c28b6b37680c894baa35cbeb05eb43c540a4cc5ec28146442c59f",
      "text": "听好了，限你10秒以内。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f2a95556e0cb150758d22a505f8a46072e45c38908b100058750a5ee73c9459",
      "text": "敢迟到的话可饶不了你！\n库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8081ba9d7fdcfbf07b7a314a1c5ac9e0b614000f4f46c27dd4d0fbe1d9ca32f",
      "text": "给本大爷的巧克力？\n知道进贡供品，干得还挺上道嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e56a803c8b606f8d850632e4e7a01d75e331c2bcfb9de04897e77394be245aa",
      "text": "既然你非要给，那我就收下了。\n好好感恩戴德吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93d2552a828f9bd1427bac2ad8d886b91f01e3d0cc9c8da3aca8245d049d8371",
      "text": "嚼嚼……味道还真不赖嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c561012abb1b692b7299b65de732cde166b0eae154fd543f80acd86d78d59ce",
      "text": "情人节巧克力，还合您的心意吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000033:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f545695f414899e2c12922c95803b7a2bcdcc154497a45064f1cc333c066280",
      "text": "因为今天是情人节，所以特意准备了巧克力哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7b2637dc89e312f09914c52b538c3c8a4c0589511e89433b3eca7f144d2aa71",
      "text": "……情人节？那算什么玩意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:789b52bea137791edc64279165ed0a69f161d5439604e3e312805cac97c96384",
      "text": "少在那儿说些莫名其妙的话，\n再多拿点巧克力过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000055:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:143a495f01c7bf045ebf78e7ac7e4ee81be4e5a5295dae7363d4d06951a0f396",
      "text": "巧克力就只有这些了，我拿其他点心给您吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a366695a518573ad8b5192331cdc95521220a45eba5989d843dacd32c57fcd2",
      "text": "啊啊？你就准备了这么点吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7270bda6102b87d2ca702a75687663ada6a0c6005c3bf0ef219313a45761f06",
      "text": "哼，快点把其他点心端上来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_040_22:5_01_040_22_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c94cc5c1141c2eab56e01d6ef38985d7ef3f741b2bd56c4e37c6982aa7120e0",
      "text": "不过，刚才那巧克力确实还不坏。\n夸你两句也无妨。明天也给我备着！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
